{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7bebeda6e94d1a09","name":"Dark Side Devotee Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7bebeda6e94d1a09","title":"Dark Side Devotee Talent Tree","revision":18082,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:33:39Z","sha256":"80188c4d7448098e8090febcf0ce24202458ef22ef5aafffae000af2a5bb669c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18082","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Dark%20Side%20Devotee%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7bebeda6e94d1a09","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your powerful negative emotions allow ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," to flow through you, giving you great power.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Channel Aggression"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you succeed on an attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flanked"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flanked"}," opponent, or any target that is denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," to deal additional damage to the target equal to 1d6 per Class Level (maximum 10d6).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Channel Anger"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Channel Aggression"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You let your anger swell into a Rage. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to gain a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to 5 + your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier. At the end of this duration, you move -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". While Raging, you cannot use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," that require patience and concentration, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Crippling Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Channel Aggression"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},", you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to also reduce the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," by half until they are fully healed (that is, restored to maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Embrace the Dark Side"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Channel Anger"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor, you may reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse. Upon choosing this Talent, you can no longer use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to imbue a weapon or some other portable object with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", creating a Talisman that grants you protection from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Light_Side"},". Creating the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]}," takes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". While you wear or carry the Talisman, you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to one of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will"},") against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can only have one ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]}," active at a given time (though you can have both a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]}," and a ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talisman"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talisman"}]}," active at the same time), and if your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]}," is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Greater Dark Side Talisman"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to imbue a weapon or some other portable object with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", creating a Talisman that grants you protection from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Light_Side"},". Creating the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Greater Dark Side Talisman"]}," takes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". While you wear or carry the Talisman, you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to all of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can only have one ",{"tag":"b","children":["Greater Dark Side Talisman"]},", or ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Side Talisman"]},", active at a given time (though you can have both a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Greater Dark Side Talisman"]}," and a ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Greater Force Talisman"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Greater_Force_Talisman"}]}," active at the same time), and if your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Greater Dark Side Talisman"]}," is destroyed, you cannot create another one for 24 hours.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
